{"4150580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unconquered Sun", "steam_appid": 4150580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150580/extras/5d88094ca5dcf0f144f6b9e972ae347e.avif?t=1785420641\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROGUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out as a small vessel in a complex and everchanging galaxy. Trade, mine, or fight; expand your ship to suit your needs with a selection of stories to follow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULLY PROCEDURAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game procedurally generates a star map, a true three dimensional field of stars at huge scale. Each star has to-scale planets and orbits and realistic calculations to define them. Stars and planets are populated by procedurally generated stations and structures with markets and economies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR SHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete with a modular ship builder and over 100 different modules. Each module has unique functions, styles, and crew bonuses.  Manage simulated heat dissipation, power generation, and weapon systems, among others. Specialise your ship and complete a unique route across the stars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIGHTSPEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Information travels at the speed of light -- what you see is from years in the past.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150580/extras/5d88094ca5dcf0f144f6b9e972ae347e.avif?t=1785420641\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROGUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out as a small vessel in a complex and everchanging galaxy. Trade, mine, or fight; expand your ship to suit your needs with a selection of stories to follow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULLY PROCEDURAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game procedurally generates a star map, a true three dimensional field of stars at huge scale. Each star has to-scale planets and orbits and realistic calculations to define them. Stars and planets are populated by procedurally generated stations and structures with markets and economies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR SHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete with a modular ship builder and over 100 different modules. Each module has unique functions, styles, and crew bonuses.  Manage simulated heat dissipation, power generation, and weapon systems, among others. Specialise your ship and complete a unique route across the stars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIGHTSPEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Information travels at the speed of light -- what you see is from years in the past.</p>", "short_description": "A space-sim and roguelite where you build your own ship and live in it. Survive in a procedural galaxy or become part of history.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150580/59b7f2d9c3364fe91040bb06b45c35b3b04c3229/header.jpg?t=1785420641", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150580/21c91d671a891bb84e673b74d782648b9766c02f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785420641", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150580/21c91d671a891bb84e673b74d782648b9766c02f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785420641", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB